mation</h4><div class="ck-content *:text-white body-text"><p>La transformation numérique bouscule vos façons de faire, avec des systèmes d’information vulnérables. Nous vous aidons à l’opérer en toute confiance.</p><ul><li>L’ISO/IEC 27001</li><li>Hébergement des données de santé</li><li>La certification DPO</li><li>Services de cloud</li></ul></div><div class="mt-2"><a href="/cybersecurite" class="btn inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-secondary flex-row-reverse"><span>En savoir plus</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full shrink-0 px-2 h-full"><div role="tabpanel" data-slot="tabs-content" inert="" class="outline-none flex flex-col md:flex-row" style="overflow:hidden;filter:blur(0px)"><div class="flex-basis relative h-[487px] mt-5 md:flex-[45%]"><img alt="image-rse-durabilite.webp" title="image-rse-durabilite.webp" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover w-full clipped-image" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="754.5px" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fuploads%2Fimage_rse_durabilite_9819e12591.webp&amp;w=32&amp;q=85 32w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fuploads%2Fimage_rse_durabilite_9819e12591.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=85 48w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fuploads%2Fimage_rse_durabilite_9819e12591.webp&amp;w=64&amp;q=85 64w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fuploads%2Fimage_rse_durabilite_9819e12591.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=85 96w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fuploads%2Fimage_rse_durabilite_9819e12591.webp&amp;w=128&amp;q=85 128w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fuploads%2Fimage_rse_durabilite_9819e12591.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 256w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fuploads%2Fimage_rse_durabilite_9819e12591.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=85 384w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fuploads%2Fimage_rse_durabilite_9819e12591.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fapi%2Fimages%2Fuploads%2Fimage_rse_durabilite_9819e