3e\u003cli\u003eLe label ISR\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eL’audit de durabilité\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"relationPost\":{\"id\":22387,\"typeOfPost\":\"page\",\"page\":{\"id\":5067,\"documentId\":\"yy4usn6u3mpx1u24873myl32\",\"title\":\"Responsabilité sociétale (RSE) avec l'ISO 26000 et CSRD\",\"slug\":\"responsabilite-societale\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-20T14:19:47.918Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-14T07:17:15.685Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-14T07:17:17.174Z\",\"locale\":\"fr\",\"publishScheduler\":\"2025-12-16T08:30:00.000Z\",\"fullSlug\":\"/responsabilite-societale\",\"description\":null,\"type_page\":\"Enjeu\",\"hide_breadcrumb\":null,\"cover\":{\"id\":758,\"documentId\":\"v7qscfq0th2x3c5x7dl2x3d0\",\"name\":\"image-rse-durabilite.webp\",\"url\":\"/uploads/image_rse_durabilite_9819e12591.webp\",\"alternativeText\":\"\",\"caption\":null,\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"hash\":\"image_rse_durabilite_9819e12591\",\"ext\":\".webp\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-05T08:41:33.354Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-16T07:09:05.119Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-16T07:09:05.119Z\"},\"enjeux\":[]},\"event\":null,\"post\":{\"id\":845,\"documentId\":\"sy41etrafnv26tlcr3autnwi\",\"title\":\"Automobile : l’électronique embarquée à l’épreuve de l’ISO 26262\",\"slug\":\"automobile-electronique-iso-26262\",\"description\":\"La norme volontaire ISO 26262 propose aux acteurs de la filière automobile des lignes directrices pour la sécurité des équipements électroniques.\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-29T13:38:26.728Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-23T13:43:28.716Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-23T13:43:30.541Z\",\"locale\":\"fr\",\"publishScheduler\":\"2019-03-20T23:30:00.000Z\",\"fullSlug\":\"/actualites/qualite/automobile-electronique-iso-26262\",\"cover\":{\"id\":108,\"documentId\":\"r6lo52cpao84cg7mlk18xkl7\",\"name\":\"automobile-electronique-embarquee.webp\",\"url\":\"/uploads/automobile_electronique_embarquee_69b9a44f9a.webp\",\"alternativeText\":null,\"caption\":null,\"width\":1920,\"height\":108